WEBVTT

00:12:29.976 --> 00:12:32.519
"Well, she doesn't have
enough business experience,"

00:12:32.519 --> 00:12:34.050
ask the question,

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:36.174
"What are we going to do about that?"

00:12:36.174 --> 00:12:38.323
It's important for H.R. executives

00:12:38.323 --> 00:12:40.955
to make sure that the missing 33 percent

00:12:40.955 --> 00:12:43.116
is appropriately emphasized,

00:12:43.116 --> 00:12:45.219
and it's important for women and men

00:12:45.219 --> 00:12:47.277
who are in management positions

00:12:47.277 --> 00:12:49.420
to examine the mindsets we hold

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.687
about women and men, about careers and success,

00:12:51.687 --> 00:12:54.398
to make sure we are creating a level playing field

00:12:54.398 --> 00:12:56.322
for everybody.

00:12:56.322 --> 00:12:58.245
So let me close with the latest chapter

00:12:58.245 --> 00:13:00.080
in Tonya's story.